{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHYr7fBBkj7ynDi8yeK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition** | **شَرْط** | **תְּנַאי**\n\n---\n\n```\nif (existence) {\n    return constraint;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nthe cut that binds\n\nthe line drawn before crossing\n\nagreement written in absence\n\n---\n\nא ש ר ט\nש ר ט א\nר ט א ש\nט א ש ר\n\n---\n\n*stipulation is a wound that heals into structure*\n\n---\n\n**شرط: to cut, to scarify, to condition**\n\n**שרט: to scratch, to incise**\n\nthe semitic root remembers:\nevery contract is a cutting\nevery condition, a mark in flesh\n\n---\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐\n│ IF ≠ THEN  │\n│ ∴ שָׁרְט    │\n└─────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\nwhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":234,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}